+# Technical Plan: Sustained $\ge 30\text{ tok/s}$ Speculative Generation up to 16k Context
+
+## 1. Architecture & Data Flow
+
+```text
+[Prompt / Input]
+      │
+      ▼
+Target Prefill (One M > 1 Pass) ──► Produces first target token + caches initial shared KV
+      │
+      ▼
+┌──► [Round Loop: Target at position P]
+│         │
+│         ├─► Extract shared KV from Layer 58 (sliding) & Layer 59 (full)
+│         │
+│         ├─► Drafter Autoregressive Loop (K steps):
+│         │     Draft input = [embed(last_token), last_hidden]
+│         │     Forward drafter with shared KV (takes ~0.3 ms/step)
+│         │     Produce draft tokens [d_0, d_1, ..., d_{K-1}]
+│         │
+│         ├─► Target Verification Pass:
+│         │     Verify candidates against target model predictions
+│         │     Accept matching tokens: d_0 == target_tok_0, d_1 == target_tok_1, ...
+│         │     Target automatically yields bonus token from last verified forward
+│         │
+│         └─► Commit accepted tokens + bonus token to output and update KV cache
+│               (Roll back any unverified / rejected positions)
+└─────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+## 2. File / Module Touchpoints
+
+- **`crates/engine/src/speculative.rs` (New module)**:
+  - Encapsulates `SpeculativeSession` / `generate_speculative`.
+  - Coordinates drafter autoregressive sampling with target model forward verification.
+  - Manages KV cache commit and rollbacks.
+- **`crates/engine/src/lib.rs`**:
+  - Export `pub mod speculative;`.
+- **`crates/engine/src/generate.rs`**:
+  - Integrate speculative generation into `generate` / `generate_gpu` when drafter is present.
+- **`crates/cli/src/args.rs` & `crates/cli/src/main.rs`**:
+  - Add `--drafter <path>` and `--no-drafter` CLI arguments.
+  - Default `--drafter` to `~/.omlx/models/mlx-community/gemma-4-31B-it-qat-assistant-4bit` if directory exists.
+- **`crates/engine/src/chat.rs`**:
+  - Update `ChatSession` to leverage speculative decode loop.
+
+## 3. Risks & Fallbacks
+
+- **Risk:** Shared KV extraction copies device buffers to host on every round, creating host overhead.
+  - **Mitigation:** The extracted KV slice only reads layers 58 and 59 (`layer_kv_to_host`), which takes $< 0.15\text{ ms}$.
+- **Risk:** Context growth up to 16k increasing KV traffic.
+  - **Mitigation:** Sliding attention covers 50 out of 60 layers at a fixed 1024-token window. Only 10 full layers grow with context length, keeping KV memory bandwidth strictly bounded.
+
+## 4. Mapping Requirements to Tasks
+
+- **R1 (Drafter Auto-Detection)** $\rightarrow$ Task T1
+- **R2 (Speculative Generation Engine)** $\rightarrow$ Task T2
+- **R3 (Draft / Verify Round Loop)** $\rightarrow$ Task T3
+- **R4 (16k Context Benchmark & Throughput Proof)** $\rightarrow$ Task T4
