+  - **Files touched:** `crates/kernels/src/linear_repacked.metal` (`linear_gemv_ishizuki_k3_rm_m4`), `crates/kernels/src/linear.rs` (`SMALLM_GEMV_KERNEL_RM`, `smallm_gemv_eligible` accepts `perm_mode` 0 or 1, new `smallm_gemv_kernel_for`), `crates/engine/tests/smallm_gemv_bit_exact.rs` (both layouts, new `Layout` enum).
