+  - **Files touched:** `crates/kernels/src/linear_repacked.metal` (`dequant_4tile_2col`, `dot4_contracted`, `accum_row_4tile_2col`, `KAPLUMBA_VERIFY_ROW`/`_ROWS4`, `linear_gemv_ishizuki_k3_colmajor_2col_sk2_m4`), `crates/kernels/src/linear.rs` (`smallm_gemv_eligible(perm_mode, ...)`, `encode_gemv_smallm`), `crates/engine/src/model.rs` (routing + `KAPLUMBA_NO_SMALLM`/`_LOG`/`_SKIP`), new `crates/engine/tests/smallm_gemv_bit_exact.rs`.
